Template: paperless-ngx/enable-imagemagick-pdf
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Enable ImageMagick PDF processing for paperless-ngx?
 Many distributions disable ImageMagick PDF decoding by default because PDFs can
 contain malware. If enabled, paperless-ngx may use ImageMagick for operations
 such as thumbnail generation. If disabled, paperless-ngx will fall back to
 Ghostscript.

Template: paperless-ngx/run-migrations
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Run Paperless-ngx database migrations now?
 Django database migrations may take a while and require a reachable database.
 If you are unsure, choose No and run migrations later with:
   paperless-ngx-manage migrate

Template: paperless-ngx/run-collectstatic
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Run Paperless-ngx collectstatic now?
 Django collectstatic will copy static assets into the configured STATIC_ROOT.
 This may take a while and may overwrite files in STATIC_ROOT.
 If you are unsure, choose No and run it later with:
   paperless-ngx-manage collectstatic --noinput
